      "description": "Watch Barcelona vs Al Ahly highlights and goals from FIFA Club World Cup on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 19, 2026. The stage was set for a monumental clash in the FIFA Club World Cup as two powerhouses from different continents measured their strength. Tactical balance and physical commitment promised a top-level spectacle from the very first whistle. Second Half Intensity and Reaction The match, held on August 19, 2026 , began with Barcelona attempting to dictate the rhythm against a resilient Al Ahly . After building an early advantage, the Spanish side saw the dynamics shift drastically at the start of the second half. In the 51st minute, Egyptian talent shone through as Zizo found the back of the net, narrowing the deficit to 2-1. The goal ignited the crowd and gave the Cairo giants the belief needed to push for an equalizer, turning the game into a battle of nerves. Drama in the Closing Stages As the clock ticked down, tension rose across the pitch. Al Ahly fought bravely, but their aggression came at a cost when A. Eid received a yellow card in the 89th minute for a heavy challenge. Shortly after, in stoppage time, Barcelona had a golden opportunity to seal the result. A. Gordon stepped up for a penalty in the 91st minute but failed to convert, keeping the score at 2-1 until the final whistle and ensuring a dramatic conclusion for the fans in attendance."
